<title>Iran and the regional confrontation: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/iran/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-iran-2026-10-23T13:39:58.758Z</guid>
<pubDate>Fri, 23 Oct 2026 13:39:58 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Iran has warned it will strike oil and AI facilities across the Gulf if attacks resume, and says seven ships were hit in the Hormuz Strait while threatening wider strikes on economic and civilian targets. US personnel were ordered to leave Saudi Arabia and diplomats were advised to depart after missiles struck King Fahd airport, killing one person and wounding eight. Lavrov visited Tehran and publicly backed Iran, hinting at possible Russian involvement. US and Israel are drafting plans for renewed strikes on Iran after the US midterm elections. 123 battle-related deaths occurred in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.aljazeera.com/features/2026/10/23/new-electronics-reach-iran-but-prices-soar-as-govt-fees-us-sanctions-hit?traffic_source=rss&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.euronews.com/2026/10/22/gulf-nations-brace-for-possible-return-to-all-out-war-between-us-and-iran&quot;&gt;Euronews&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMihgFBVV95cUxOZ29wOWwxY2tHX2JGOVJFWWQ3V3g1RG1GaVIzdjA3QUp2VldoZVNFZ0VUQzhSQ3ZiOHdyaWhvMFpxZi1hbFNib1hXUHJMNFJzOU9JaVRLaWdHSkFaZWxlTndqTVhXUUpEYU1JR3hrTHdiMHItNDF5cXl4RGZKSGI2R0NDcHF4Zw?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Washington Post&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMinwFBVV95cUxORnVtbXdVNGp0NmpKbTE1MzdLbnRRTEZOLXJmWXRqdTRBSTZ5OVM2SF85V1FwbzA2VlJWYWpGUjRqeURkRVM3X2lPbDJxWFkyUHRGeFFTNmRDMk11SVNTSVVzVjBhUTBCeFgzMGZMeEUwNVdYWW5nYWZnelQxMGtqQk5DY1lPdmR1ajVjVGp0NGloaWFOTC1wdklGVGFEOWs?oc=5&quot;&gt;Reuters&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiwAFBVV95cUxQcnVxMnpPdU1HY3hTSHk2T3I3U0dvZHMwbU9DT2pvb1NEb1RnRDNxNWF1LVdKSm5QS2RQbThQRUtJbkE0OHpUX2pESGF2azBUUTNTMDMwQXZQY24yQkJ5UUtnTnMxemUxdW5xM1Z4bGFDTFZ